0eancia.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a21904-ae11-7c16-a14b-eae9daf48729","description":"Vermelho, branco e azul","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a21904-ae11-7387-b7c2-2c2d77f7f49e","description":"Verde, branco e vermelho","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a21904-ae11-7d26-8efd-a13dc1f97d0f","description":"amarelo, branco e azul","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a21904-ae11-7c2b-bdbf-7b8fa15fae92","description":"vermelho, branco e amarelo","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a21904-ae11-798a-b23b-3c17446a191f","category":"01a2135e-b9ba-7c16-9b72-2e444808bbc8","question":"Que tipo de calend\u00e1rio \u00e9 usado para contar os dias que faltam at\u00e9 o Natal e costuma ter uma guloseima atr\u00e1s de cada janelinha?","difficulty":1,"explanation":"Um calend\u00e1rio do Advento tem, tradicionalmente, 24 portinhas numeradas, que s\u00e3o abertas uma por dia, de 1\u00ba de dezembro at\u00e9 a v\u00e9spera de Natal. As vers\u00f5es modernas podem esconder brinquedos ou atividades em vez de doces.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a21904-ae11-70b9-9210-6ef435f6d810","description":"Um calend\u00e1rio do Advento","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a21904-ae11-7235-aa64-5d92ac6c8a54","description":"Um calend\u00e1rio sagrado","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a21904-ae11-7d71-8c21-f3f8cc474d10","description":"Um calend\u00e1rio do Kwanzaa","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a21904-ae11-7527-9d1e-bdd4ea15895e","description":"Um calend\u00e1rio de contagem regressiva","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a21904-ae11-7798-a7df-9fa3360bd173","category":"01a2135e-b9ba-7c16-9b72-2e444808bbc8","question":"Qual dessas cores \u00e9 tradicionalmente associada ao Natal?","difficulty":1,"explanation":"O vermelho aparece com destaque nas bagas do azevinho e em muitas representa\u00e7\u00f5es do Papai Noel, o que contribui para torn\u00e1-lo uma cor natalina familiar.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a21904-ae11-7b1b-9dcc-8b2ecd719679","description":"Vermelho","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a21904-ae11-7c6e-8d17-c65e9bad1154","description":"Laranja","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a21904-ae11-7d0c-9345-39e0fb18be2e","description":"Azul","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a21904-ae11-7972-bfcc-b5382c962a2e","description":"Roxo","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a21904-ae11-7750-9d67-4b9b27e4bde2","category":"01a2135e-b9ba-7c16-9b72-2e444808bbc8","question":"Com qual das op\u00e7\u00f5es a seguir os totens s\u00e3o mais comumente associados?","difficulty":1,"explanation":"Os totens s\u00e3o associados \u00e0s culturas ind\u00edgenas, embora as tradi\u00e7\u00f5es variem amplamente entre os povos ind\u00edgenas; alguns povos da Costa Noroeste, por exemplo, esculpem totens ligados \u00e0s hist\u00f3rias familiares.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a21904-ae11-75a8-84c5-fc9c8076947e","description":"Culturas ind\u00edgenas","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a21904-ae11-70b5-9e80-481433392778","description":"Empresas modernas","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a21904-ae11-76e8-a337-f8cfe401955c","description":"Cidades-estado da Gr\u00e9cia Antiga","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a21904-ae11-7aad-bd6b-ac9e800e90ad","description":"Guildas da Europa medieval","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a21904-ae11-71d8-9521-6fe643f0c1b0","category":"01a2135e-b9ba-7c16-9b72-2e444808bbc8","question":"Qual \u00e9 a cor tradicional associada ao Dia de S\u00e3o Patr\u00edcio?","difficulty":1,"explanation":"O verde est\u00e1 associado ao trevo e ao apelido da Irlanda, a Ilha Esmeralda. Usar essa cor \u00e9 um costume popular no Dia de S\u00e3o Patr\u00edcio.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a21904-ae11-7718-8233-dff71abd6eaf","description":"Verde","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a21904-ae11-75a7-9e4d-3d28fed34972","description":"Azul","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a21904-ae11-7a31-8154-2db2dc829e35","description":"Vermelho","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a21904-ae11-78cf-ac4f-e250212b1a33","description":"Amarelo","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a21904-ae11-7624-a80c-69c1662a9a0a","category":"01a2135e-b9ba-7c1